        "x": -504,
        "y": 120
      },
      "data": {
        "html": "<h1>Summary</h1><p></p><p>Our team wanted to accommodate increasing customer's needs in time series data anomaly detection (tsAD). I helped the team to define the product scope, establish project lifecycle, and design and test the UI from scratch.</p><p>The MVP was adopted by 300+ customers, quickly validating our initial direction. This may not be a big number in consumer section, but for a specialized domain, it was a strong signal that we were solving a real customer need.</p>"
      },
      "width": 336,
      "height": 280
